description	"Jango Fett

The greatest bounty hunter in the galaxy during his day, boasting a wide armory and a slew of offensive gadgets.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- WESTAR-34 Blaster Pistols (3)
-- Non-disarmable
-- 5% faster RoF
-- 5% faster velocity
-- 5% more damage/FP damage
- Wrist Flamethrower (Thrower)
-- Non-disarmable
-- 20% slower RoF
-- 7900% slower reload

^6Inventory:
- Binoculars

^8Attributes:
- Beskar (3)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- 15% less knockback taken
- 5% less knockback given
- 25% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack
-- No cooldown
- Rocket ^3[CS1]
-- Staggers on det
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS2]
- Velocity-7 Poison Dart Shooter ^3[Melee ^3CS3]
-- Tracks on hit
-- 100% more damage
- Gun Kick ^3[CS4]"
